  "Orfeo {{v0}} is out. Click to download": "",
  "Orfeo handling the key": "Orfeo 处理按键",
  "Orfeo is here to make your musical journey a little more enjoyable, one note at a time. A rating in the Microsoft Store helps other musicians find it, and it only takes a moment.": "",
  "Orfeo is here to make your musical journey a little more enjoyable, one note at a time. It's free and made by one musician. Here's how you can help it grow.": "",
  "Orfeo measures how late your sound output plays and lights keys, counts in and reads taps to match. If it still feels off — Bluetooth headphones, or General MIDI played through an external instrument — shift it here. This moves the picture, not the sound: no setting can make a note arrive sooner.": "Orfeo 会测量声音输出延迟，并调整琴键亮起、预备拍和敲击读取的时机。若蓝牙耳机或外部 GM 乐器仍有偏差，可在此调整。此设置只移动画面，不改变声音；任何设置都无法让声音提前到达。",
  "Orfeo shares the sound card with everything else, so you still hear YouTube, video calls and other apps alongside it. Windows adds its usual delay between key and sound.": "Orfeo 与其他应用共享声卡，因此可同时听到 YouTube、视频通话等声音。Windows 会带来通常的按键到发声延迟。",
  "Orfeo takes over the whole sound card: other apps stay silent while Orfeo is open.": "Orfeo 独占整个声卡，打开期间其他应用将无法发声。",
  "Orfeo talks to your sound card directly, past Windows' mixer: the shortest delay from key to sound. Recommended when the delay between pressing a key and hearing it feels uncomfortable.": "Orfeo 绕过 Windows 混音器，直接访问声卡，尽量缩短按键到发声的延迟。按键与声音间的延迟影响演奏时建议使用。",
  "Orfeo's built-in synth": "Orfeo 内置合成器",
