  "Soft pedal": "柔音踏板",
  "Some keyboards now and then send one key press twice in a row — a worn key contact, for example. Repeats of the same key closer together than this are ignored.": "某些键盘偶尔会将一次按键发送两次，例如触点磨损时。相同按键在此间隔内的重复触发会被忽略。",
