  "The demo songs that come with Orfeo are hidden from your Library. Turn on to show them again.": "Orfeo 自带演示曲目已在曲库中隐藏。开启可重新显示。",
  "The demo songs that come with Orfeo are shown in your Library. Turn off to hide them — nothing is deleted.": "Orfeo 自带演示曲目显示在曲库中。关闭后仅隐藏，不删除任何文件。",
  "The everyday switches — sound engine, note names, keyboard, piano roll and more.": "常用开关：音源引擎、音名、键盘、钢琴卷帘等。",
  "The export came out silent — check the master volume and the muted parts.": "",
  "The export was far too quiet to be worth a file — turn the volume up, or unmute some parts, and try again.": "",
  "The hints that pop up when you point at a button, knob or icon. Turn them off once you know your way around. A knob still shows its value while you turn it.": "指向按钮、旋钮或图标时弹出说明。熟悉操作后可关闭；旋转旋钮时仍显示数值。",
  "The line where notes meet the keyboard.": "音符与键盘相遇的线。",
