  "The same sound sets as Studio, played by Orfeo's own engine straight to your sound card: the shortest delay from key to sound. Windows only.": "与 Studio 使用相同的音色库，由 Orfeo 自有引擎直接送到声卡，尽量缩短按键到发声的延迟。仅限 Windows。",
  "The simple synth built into Orfeo: light, always ready, no sound set needed. It sounds basic — good for slow computers, or for playing through an external instrument (MIDI Keyboard › General MIDI sound).": "Orfeo 内置的简单合成器：轻量、随时可用，无需音色库。音色较基础，适合较慢的电脑或通过外部乐器播放（MIDI 键盘 › General MIDI 声音）。",
  "The song as written: every instrument, its own tempo and key.": "",
  "The song's current playback tempo,\nscaled by your speed setting.\nDouble-click to type a tempo.": "",
  "The sound buffer size changes the next time Orfeo starts.": "声音缓冲区大小将在下次启动 Orfeo 时更改。",
  "The sound output part is set by the system and your sound card: wired headphones or a USB audio interface lower it, Bluetooth raises it a lot.": "",
