  "What the live chord display and the Lock-A-Chord window follow during playback: Auto (the chord instruments), Harmony (everything but drums) or Follow (one instrument or group you choose).": "设置播放时实时和弦显示和锁定和弦窗口的跟踪对象：自动（和弦乐器）、和声（除鼓外的所有乐器）或跟随（选择单个乐器或乐器组）。",
  "When a keyboard is plugged in": "连接键盘时",
