  "Your beat lands exactly between the file's beats: its bar lines are right, it just counts half as fast.": "你的节拍正好落在文件节拍之间：小节线正确，只是文件计数速度慢一半。",
  "Your beat lands exactly on every 2nd beat of the file: its bar lines are right, it just counts twice as fast.": "你的节拍正好落在文件每两拍中的一拍上：小节线正确，只是文件计数速度快一倍。",
  "Your beat matches the file's own beat exactly: its tempo is already right here.": "你的节拍与文件节拍完全一致：这里的速度已经正确。",
  "Your keys go through the song's compressor with it, so they sit in the same mix — about 12 ms later.": "按键与曲目一同经过压缩器，融入同一混音，约延后 12 毫秒。",
  "Your keys skip the song's compressor and limiter, and are heard about 12 ms sooner.": "按键绕过曲目的压缩器与限幅器，约提前 12 毫秒发声。",
